            "answer": "<p>At the moment, Cash on Delivery (COD) is not available. We currently accept prepaid orders only through secure payment methods such as UPI, credit/debit cards, net banking, and digital wallets. This helps us process orders faster and keep payments secure.</p>"
          }
        },
        {
          "type": "faq_item",
          "settings": {
            "question": "What are the shipping charges?",
            "answer": "<p>We offer FREE shipping across India on all prepaid orders above ₹499.</p><p>For orders below ₹499, a standard shipping charge will be applied at checkout.</p><p>All applicable shipping charges will be clearly displayed during checkout before you complete your purchase—there are no hidden charges.</p>"
          }
        },
        {
